14th August.  Jack Savoretti @ Kelvingrove Bandstand

@jacksavoretti 

Another night at the gorgeous Bandstand in Kelvingrove park to see Jack Savoretti this time. What a voice!! It was such a beautiful night enjoying a stripped back performance, mostly just him and his guitar or on the piano. He kept the audience entranced with his vocals and stories which to me felt like such an intimate night and a privilege to have been there. ❤️

